{"title":"Let them fight","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/let-them-fight","date":1750440770000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you try to avoid wet bulb temperature.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/fbf72651-2f3f-485b-a7f0-ad176d1aecca/GettyImages-2220453407.jpg?t=1750438632\" /><div><span><p>(Barbara Davidson/Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, maybe the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/19/no-kings-how-many-protesters-was?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">biggest protest in US history</a> was enough to bully<a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/culture/culture-news/jd-vance-blusky-trans-rights-blocked-1235368373/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\"> JD Vance off Bluesky</a>, but not enough to stop President Donald Trump from supporting Israel's attacks on Iran. Get in loser, we're doing <a href=\"https://newrepublic.com/article/197002/united-states-war-iran-iraq-madness?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">2003 Part 2!</a> Except now all the warmongers, like <i><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_K0sRkvX4KE&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">BuzzFeed</a></i><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_K0sRkvX4KE&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\"> lost causer</a> Sen. Ted Cruz, can <a href=\"https://www.thewrap.com/ted-cruz-tucker-carlson-star-wars-meme-luke-skywalker/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">get generative AI</a> to do all the manufacturing consent for them. In a complete coincidence, OpenAI, the company founded to <a href=\"https://www.vanityfair.com/news/2016/06/elon-musk-household-robot?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">avoid making Skynet</a>, now has a <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/openai-wins-200-million-us-defense-contract-2025-06-16/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">$200 million defense contract</a> to develop Skynet. Maybe it can lay siege to Cinderella Castle, after <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cg5vjqdm1ypo?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">Disney sued Midjourney</a> in the biggest copyright case against AI yet. We'd say \"let them fight,\" except we might get in <a href=\"https://japantoday.com/category/crime/man-arrested-for-selling-ai-colorized-pirated-1954-godzilla-film?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">legal trouble ourselves</a>. </p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/electrolemon/status/1934813085086437502?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">Good X post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/vodam46/786233133701988352?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">Minimize, close, maximize</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/theories/comments/1l5e9k9/trying_to_come_up_with_a_new_shape_and_i_cant_i/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">A redditor is trying to make a new shape</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/mattybtweets69/status/1931020921415868701?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">Music summer</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/rudy_betrayed/status/1935156977333936407?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">The Rizzler met Queens Of The Stone Age for some reason</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/WritingWithAI/s/yPQBqLwUeO?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">Amazing Reddit question</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/TheDailyShow/status/1935073196157366613?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">The winner of the Pedro Pascal lookalike contest works for </a><a href=\"https://x.com/TheDailyShow/status/1935073196157366613?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\"><i>The Daily Show</i></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/kinofabino.bsky.social/post/3lryelpe2ys2z?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">A great crossover</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/TheBirdist/status/1935786412172791930?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">yenk</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/zuza_real/status/1930007388104601968?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">Some good prose</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/despazito/786846795407966208?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=let-them-fight\" target=\"_blank\">Cyberwigan</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\